# Volt lower front cabin and rounder sides — 2026-10-31

The front roof and windshield were lowered through the existing cabin arc, while the marked window base and square-root-like bonnet profile remain in place. The door cross-sections now have a broad outward crown instead of the former central inward hollow. Door handles, wheel arches and mirrors continue to follow their underlying surfaces; handling configuration and wheel positions were not changed.

In the unscaled authoring meshes, a sampled point on the forward windshield moved from y=1.2021 to y=1.1347, while its foot stays at y=0.9700. At the three sampled door stations, the center of each panel was previously 11.6–21.6 mm inward from the chord between upper and lower samples; it is now 20.0–21.8 mm outward. The new actual-mesh test passes 16/16 in both procedural and prepared models; the exact task-start body and cabin fail 14/16. These dimensions describe selected samples, not an owner appearance verdict.

The retained prepared tests pass: cabin/hood 12/12, door 100/100, reference model 150/150, handle 30/30, sport nose 8/8, optics 16/16 and previous nose 10/10. Preview identity passes 5/5. Actual Compatibility Garage/race checks pass 58/58; the run logged frame hitches and does not establish device performance. Both desktop Compatibility and desktop Mobile captured 18 clean/worn views. The actual [side](evidence/volt-lower-front-round-sides-2026-10-31/gl_compatibility/side-opposite-clean.png), [front three-quarter](evidence/volt-lower-front-round-sides-2026-10-31/gl_compatibility/front-quarter-low-clean.png) and [race](evidence/volt-lower-front-round-sides-2026-10-31/app/race.png) views were inspected; owner appearance acceptance remains open.

The Electric prepared meshes, shadow proxies, Garage template, and Electric preview pictures were regenerated. The existing Electric mesh-root cache identity ensures old saved Garage pictures do not conceal this geometry. Only the Electric Garage template was rebuilt because other vehicles have concurrent edits; their older editor templates may be rejected by the shared source guard until their own refresh. Godot editor import completed with an unavailable Android build-tools warning. No Android build or device test was performed.
